@page "/"
@* The Player page (UI-SPEC 4.3, phone 5.3): the now-playing hero (with the master volume) on the left, the Output and
   Status cards stacked on the right at >= 1024px; one column below, in the order hero, Output, Status. The <h1> is
   visually hidden (the hero is the visible title) and focusable for FocusOnNavigate. *@
@inherits BridgeComponentBase

<PageTitle>@L.Format("app.pageTitle", ("page", L["nav.player"]))</PageTitle>

<h1 class="visually-hidden" tabindex="-1">@L["nav.player"]</h1>

<div class="player">
    <NowPlayingHero />
    <div class="player__side">
        <OutputList />
        <StatusCard />
    </div>
</div>
